      "hints": [
        "Identify geometric progression with ratio $r = 1.10$ and $u_{21} = x(1.10)^{20} = 20$.",
        "Solve for $x = \\frac{20}{1.10^{20}} \\approx 3.0\\text{ km}$."
      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        "Identify the progression type: geometric progression with first term $x$ and common ratio $r = 1 + 0.10 = 1.10$.",
        "Set up the equation for the distance on day $21$ ($u_{21} = 20\\text{ km}$):\n$$u_{21} = x(1.10)^{21-1} = x(1.10)^{20} = 20$$",
        "Solve for $x$:\n$$x = \\frac{20}{(1.10)^{20}} = \\frac{20}{6.72750} \\approx 2.9729 \\approx 3.0\\text{ km} \\quad (\\text{to 1 d.p.})$$"
      ],
